# The session marker (docs/mechanics/marker.md): set rolling at 5 m/s on the lab floor, ollie and start
# a kickflip, and go back to the marker mid-air: the skater is on the marker at once, rolling the same
# way at the same speed, and the kickflip in progress is dropped (no combo banks, no bail).
park lab
cmd 0 teleport -20 -15 0.13 90
cmd 6 speed 5
cmd 30 marker set
hold ollie 60..80
tap flip+left 84
cmd 100 marker go
run 200
expect event marker{op=set,ok=true} within 31..31
expect event trickStart{trick=Kickflip} within 84..90
expect event marker{op=go,ok=true} within 101..101
expect skater.pos.x < -18.8 at 101
expect skater.pos.x > -19.2 at 101
expect skater.speed > 4.8 at 110
expect skater.vel.x > 4.8 at 110
expect no event comboLanded
expect no event bail
